   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health: Resource multilateral agencies and international partners to put in place appropriate, effective, rapid, prioritised and targeted interventions to support Zika and Yellow Fever outbreak.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Health: Resource multilateral agencies and international partners to put in place appropriate, effective, rapid, prioritised and targeted interventions to support Zika and Yellow Fever outbreak. is a component of Health: UK support for regional preparedness to prevent the spread of Ebola reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;4,000,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Disaster prevention and preparedness, Infectious disease control.</narrative>
  </description>
